{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3334","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3334/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3334/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/issues/3334/events","html_url":"https://github.com/xunit/xunit/issues/3334","id":3184709882,"node_id":"I_kwDOAJbtsc690tD6","number":3334,"title":"`CaptureConsoleAttribute` does not capture console output from constructors for first test case","user":{"login":"ShadowDog007","id":3084997,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODQ5OTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3084997?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShadowDog007","html_url":"https://github.com/ShadowDog007","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShadowDog007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShadowDog007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShadowDog007/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShadowDog007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShadowDog007/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShadowDog007/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShadowDog007/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShadowDog007/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ShadowDog007/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":75574707,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3NTU3NDcwNw==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"FEF2C0","default":false,"description":"A fault in an existing feature"},{"id":241290899,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNDEyOTA4OTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/xunit/xunit/labels/Core%20framework","name":"Core framework","color":"BFD4F2","default":false,"description":"xunit.v3.core"}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-06-28T07:58:02Z","updated_at":"2025-07-01T01:57:10Z","closed_at":"2025-07-01T01:57:10Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"`CaptureConsoleAttribute` uses `BeforeAfterTestAttribute` to replace console output stream with a captured stream.\n\nBecause `.Before` is only called after test classes are constructed and initialized (in the case of `IAsyncLifetime` implementations), any output from the constructor or `.InitializeAsync` methods is not captured by the first test which runs.\n\nTo reproduce, you can run any test class with console output \n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/568695f4-9da0-42f1-a31b-d816d7e8f71b)\n\nWhen running the tests together, the first to run has no output.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/10bb74d1-cf64-4c9f-b9e5-1b0a05895741)\n\nThe second test case captures the output as expected.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/192c6bad-e65f-40f5-9c54-6d5086849336)\n\n\n[ShadowDog007/xunit-capture-console-defect-example](https://github.com/ShadowDog007/xunit-capture-console-defect-example)","closed_by":{"login":"bradwilson","id":16944,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2OTQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16944?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson","html_url":"https://github.com/bradwilson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwilson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bradwi